  "evidencia": "Page: Georg von Tiesenhausen. Sentence: Georg F. von Tiesenhausen (born May 18, 1914) is a retired German-American rocket scientist.\nPage: Operation Paperclip. Sentence: Operation Paperclip was a secret program of the Joint Intelligence Objectives Agency (JIOA) in which more than 1,600 German scientists, engineers, and technicians, such as Wernher von Braun and his V-2 rocket team, were recruited in post-Nazi Germany and taken to the U.S. for government employment, at the end of World War II; many were members and some were leaders of the Nazi Party.",
